	"system": {
		"description": "<p>The damage dealt by your @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-heritage-features.Item.WeWCiJ6GVbbISwmH]{Digger’s Claws} now counts as magical for the purposes of overcoming damage resistance.</p><p>Additionally, as an action, you may slam your fists into the ground, causing it to crack and erupt around you. Creatures within a 10-foot radius of you must succeed on a Dexterity saving throw versus your maneuver DC or be knocked [[/condition id=prone]]. This area becomes difficult terrain for all creatures other than you for a number of rounds equal to your Constitution modifier. You may use this ability a number of times equal to your proficiency bonus per long rest.</p>",
